{"id":"n73269-1-8","stage":1,"title":"피 · 血","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73269-1-8-1","ko":"너 손에서 피가 나잖아! 어쩌다 그랬어?","zh":"你手上在流血啊！是怎么弄成这样的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손에서","meaning":"手","explanation":"손：手；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"손","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17608","senseId":"1","lemma":"손","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"피가","meaning":"血，血液","explanation":"피：血，血液；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"피","audio":"/audio/9c6661386be05570418b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73269","senseId":"1","lemma":"피","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나잖아!","meaning":"流","explanation":"나다：流；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"18","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어쩌다","meaning":"指“什么”、“怎么”。","explanation":"어쩌다：指“什么”、“怎么”。","readings":[{"term":"어쩌다","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29765","senseId":"2","lemma":"어쩌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그랬어?","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"27d4fa6af704520d","term":"손","zh":"手","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3","entryId":"17608","definition":"位于手腕的末端，用于摸某物或抓某物时使用的肢体中一部分。","pronunciation":["손"]},{"id":"9c6661386be05570","term":"피","zh":"血，血液","audio":"/audio/9c6661386be05570418b.mp3","entryId":"73269","definition":"循环于人或动物体内血管的红色液体，其作用为供给氧气和养分、运输排泄物等。","pronunciation":["피"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"流","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"身上流出汗、血、泪水等。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"85a8c2b5d5fccc03","term":"어쩌다","zh":"指“什么”、“怎么”。","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3","entryId":"29765","definition":"指“什么”、“怎么”。","pronunciation":["어쩌다"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/6227a6c078701ad56d82.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73269-1-8-2","ko":"양파를 썰다가 칼에 베었지 뭐야.","zh":"切洋葱的时候被刀割到了呗。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"양파를","meaning":"洋葱","explanation":"양파：洋葱；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"양파","audio":"/audio/192b2b8ddac76aa30d32.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67246","senseId":"1","lemma":"양파","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"썰다가","meaning":"切，锯","explanation":"썰다：切，锯；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"썰다","audio":"/audio/0ca57aae18c4738f3675.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29774","senseId":"1","lemma":"썰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"칼에","meaning":"刀","explanation":"칼：刀；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"칼","audio":"/audio/4eaedee29619f832b4df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26905","senseId":"1","lemma":"칼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"베었지","meaning":"划伤，割伤","explanation":"베다：划伤，割伤；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"베다","audio":"/audio/1b1a0ff24ae13402f9bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14464","senseId":"2","lemma":"베다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐야.","meaning":"什么，怎么回事","explanation":"뭐：什么，怎么回事；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"3","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"192b2b8ddac76aa3","term":"양파","zh":"洋葱","audio":"/audio/192b2b8ddac76aa30d32.mp3","entryId":"67246","definition":"呈球状，味辣且具有特殊香味的蔬菜。","pronunciation":["양파"]},{"id":"0ca57aae18c4738f","term":"썰다","zh":"切，锯","audio":"/audio/0ca57aae18c4738f3675.mp3","entryId":"29774","definition":"用刀或锯向下摁并前后移动而将某物轧断或弄成许多块。","pronunciation":["썰ː다"]},{"id":"4eaedee29619f832","term":"칼","zh":"刀","audio":"/audio/4eaedee29619f832b4df.mp3","entryId":"26905","definition":"用于削、切或割东西的工具。","pronunciation":["칼"]},{"id":"1b1a0ff24ae13402","term":"베다","zh":"划伤，割伤","audio":"/audio/1b1a0ff24ae13402f9bf.mp3","entryId":"14464","definition":"用有刀刃的东西在身上弄出伤口或切掉身上的一部分。","pronunciation":["베ː다"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么，怎么回事","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"对于已经发生的意外事件或状况，强调自己的惊讶、后悔、遗憾的话。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/1b333501772249cd5d2b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.809,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=73269","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":54,"sequenceScore":2.4066,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["切洋葱的时候被刀割到了呗。","你手上在流血啊！是怎么弄成这样的？","来，我们一起去警察局吧！"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你手上在流血啊！是怎么弄成这样的？","来，我们一起去警察局吧！","切洋葱的时候被刀割到了呗。"],"answer":2}]}
